{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼ぼくのお腹の中／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/3655258/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毒きのこを食べた\nぼくのお腹の中"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんてね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/3655258/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ケータイカバーのベースに\nいろいろ縫い付けてみた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/3655258/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"図工というか手芸？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"苔ケータイ\nもっとコケコケしくすれば\nよかったかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/3655258/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会に来た人のことって\n覚えてるもん？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/3655258/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"記憶力が低いのですが...\n覚えたいです><"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/3655258/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう秋田は雪でうまってます！\n何して遊ぶ？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/3655258/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりあえず、足で雪をずぼずぼ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/3655258/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっかの座右の銘は？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/3655258/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自然体"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/3655258/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほっぺ奪うシーンは一発OK？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/3655258/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあ...余裕で一発っす。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...うそですごめんなさい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/3655258/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"靴下の色って自分で選んだの?\nそれともスタッフさんに渡されたの?"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/3655258/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スタッフさんです！\n緑運強い！ふっふー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/3655258/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美術館とかは\n好きじゃないんですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/3655258/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"興味深いです。\nアートすきだ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/3655258/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バイトとかしたことあるの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/3655258/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ない！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/3655258/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブで一番やりたい曲って\nなんなん？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/3655258/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全曲すきだから、全部じゃだめ⁇"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/3655258/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スマホを上手になるコツは？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/3655258/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"慣れだよ～\n慣れたらメールとか\n文字ひょいひょい打てちゃうよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/3655258/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すきなご飯のおかずは？←"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/3655258/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は納豆。\n納豆に食べるラー油イイネ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/3655258/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/3655258/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/3655258/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポン酢も美味！\nあ、砂糖はまだ試してない..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/3655258/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私服がオシャレなのは誰？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/3655258/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなそれぞれ個性的で\nかわいいだと思う。\n自分だったら絶対着れないものを\n着てたりすると参考になります♪\n私はななみの格好すきだな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/3655258/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/3655258/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こたつ派？ストーブ派？\nそれとも暖房派？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/3655258/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こたつとかうらやましいー\n部屋用に新しいストーブ頼んだんだ^^\nストーブ派かな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/3655258/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんなジャンルの音楽好き？\nロックとかパンクとかに興味ある？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/3655258/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幅広く。\nロックは...ゆるめ？のを聴きます。\nアジカンさん、flumpoolさん、\nGalileoGalileiさん、相対性理論さん\n他に東京事変さん！\n最近はアイドルだったら9nineさん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/3655258/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お兄ちゃんロックバンド詳しいから\nおすすめの聴いたりしてるんだーよ。\n私がすきそうなの入れてくれるんだ^^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/3655258/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日はねねとデート"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/3655258/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...だって、ね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どっしゃあああああああ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/3655258/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/3655258/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/3655258/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/3655258/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...おやすみなさい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}